  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Next future or simple future",
   "texto": [
    "For what happens already or very soon, use **aller** + infinitive: **Je vais travailler demain** (I will work tomorrow).",
    "For what will happen later or for a prediction, use the simple future: **Dans dix ans, je travaillerai à l'étranger** (within ten years, I will work abroad)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "When you talk about the future with quand",
